@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K53_411
	;Combat Training.
CALL D_LINE
IF !SHIRAHU(53)
	PRINTFORMDL You exercise for a little while...
	PRINTFORMDW
	RETURN 1
ENDIF
IF MARK:反発刻印 > 2 || CFLAG:ブチギレ
	PRINTFORMDL You've started warming up when you hear Tewi's voice nearby...
	PRINTFORMDW
	PRINTFORML 「Are you practicing? Let me help～」
	PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"Before you can turn to look, something heavy clamps around your wrists and ankles. A pair of metal cuffs as heavy as dumbbells are padlocked onto your arms!")%
	PRINTFORML 「These are a good way to build up strength! Don't worry, they're extra secure―!」
	PRINTFORMDL Tewi appears before you with an evil grin...
	PRINTFORMW 「Now, let's begin the training!」
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORMDL ...It was a gruelling gauntlet of bullets, traps, and sneak attacks by rabbits. 
	IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
		PRINTFORMDL However, you managed to get through it relatively well...
		EXP:MASTER:戦闘経験 += 2
		CALL RECOVER(MASTER, -200, "体力", "Ambushed")
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDL However, you somehow feel as if it really made you stronger...
		EXP:MASTER:戦闘経験 += 2
		CALL RECOVER(MASTER, -800, "体力", "Ambushed")
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDL You and Tewi play together while training...
PRINTFORMDW
SELECTCASE RAND:7
	CASE 0
		PRINTFORML 「Okay, try shooting me!」
		PRINTFORMDL Tewi darts around the area, attempting to avoid your attacks.
		IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < (ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力-1)
			PRINTFORMDL She's so fast, you can't hit her at all...
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL She's so fast, you can only occasionally graze her. Or maybe she's getting close on purpose...
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 == ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL She's fast, and seems to always go in the direction you don't expect, but you still manage to hit her.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力+1
			PRINTFORMDL Despite her impressive speed and luck, the difference in skill between you is obvious.
			PRINTFORMDL You toy with her a little bit, inventing new ways to trap her with your bullets.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL Despite her impressive speed and luck, your skilled shooting finds its mark. You're definitely better than her at Danmaku.
		ENDIF
	CASE 1
		PRINTFORML 「Hehe, let's work on your dodging skills!」
		PRINTFORMDL Tewi starts chasing you, firing bullets in your direction.
		IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < (ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力-1)
			PRINTFORMDL You're quickly overwhelmed...
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL You graze through it for a while, but you can't last and are eventually struck down.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 == ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL You put up a good resistance to her barrage and manage to come out the other end.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力+1
			PRINTFORMDL Despite her impressive speed and luck, the difference in skill between you is obvious.
			PRINTFORMDL You toy with her a little bit, intentionally grazing her bullet patterns to make it more challenging.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL Despite her clever tactics, you're one step ahead of her. You manage to dodge everything flawlessly.
		ENDIF
	CASE 2
		PRINTFORML 「Strong magic comes from beauty! Therefore, we have to train your \@ IS_MALE(MASTER) ? masculinity # femininity\@!」
		IF IS_MALE(MASTER)
			PRINTFORMDL Saying this, Tewi commands you to dodge her bullets while %SPLIT_G(@"posing shirtless:lifting rabbits like dumbbells:flexing your muscles:eating a cooked steak:complimenting her like a gentleman:roaring with manly passion")%.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL Saying this, Tewi commands you to dodge her bullets while %SPLIT_G(@"curtsying:gossiping with her:practicing flower arrangement:sewing a cute accessory:applying makeup:practicing girlish giggles:combing and styling your hair")%.
		ENDIF
		IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < (ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力-1)
			PRINTFORMDL Doing it this way is hopeless...
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL The added difficulty is too much. You can't last for very long before you're hit.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 == ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL You put up a good effort in spite of the handicap.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力+1
			PRINTFORMDL Despite the handicap, the difference in skill between you is obvious.
			PRINTFORMDL You show her the superior style of a true %PRINT_MALE("man", MASTER)%, causing her to swoon.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL You somehow manage to dodge everything despite the handicap.
		ENDIF
	CASE 3
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Rabbits have rich martial arts traditions, you know.:The truth is, I'm actually the heir to a secret form of rabbit martial arts!:You may not know this, but most of the world's greatest martial artists have been rabbits!:Kick-based martial arts are the strongest. That's why rabbits are the strongest warriors!")%」
		PRINTFORMDL You don't think that's true, but you accept Tewi's offer to help you train anyway.
		PRINTFORMDL Following her advice, you %SPLIT_G(@"meditate beneath a rabbitfall... that is, a succession of rabbits jumping on your head and shoulders:meditate while balancing with one foot on top of a rabbit:pound mochi with a mallet for a while:do push-ups with your fingers while protecting baby rabbits under your palms:practice catching hopping rabbits with your bare hands:practice by striking a giant carrot with your fists:repeatedly lift a stack of rabbits with Tewi on top")%.
		PRINTFORMDL Somehow, it feels like you got stronger...?
	CASE 4
		PRINTFORML 「The secret to dodging bullets is dexterity and reflexes!」
		PRINTFORML 「Therefore, take this!」
		PRINTFORMDL Tewi begins throwing a barrage of %SPLIT_G(@"rabbits:carrots:unknown potions:bamboo chunks")% at you.
		IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < (ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力-1)
			PRINTFORMDL You're knocked to the ground and buried before you can react...
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 < ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL You react quickly enough not to be taken off guard, but some of them still hit you.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 == ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力
			PRINTFORMDL Although it takes you by surprise, you weather the storm of improvised projectiles.
		ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:TARGET:戦闘能力+1
			PRINTFORMDL Even with such an ambush, you easily succeed at her trial.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL You're ready for her attack, and manage to avoid it all with some effort.
		ENDIF
	CASE 5
		PRINTFORML 「Let's consult the rabbit sage!」
		PRINTFORMDL Tewi holds up a rabbit sporting a long beard and moustache.
		PRINTFORMDL 「The secret to greater power is... %SPLIT_G(@"You must collect the seven Rabbit Balls!:a donation to the rabbit sage!:You must collect a thousand million pairs of girls' panties!:a diet entirely of boiled carrots!:lots and lots of energy drinks!:a secret!:You must locate the jeweled branch of Hourai!")%」
		PRINTFORML 「The sage has spoken―!」
		PRINTFORMDL ...You decide to do some regular training.
	CASE 6
		PRINTDATAL
			DATAFORM 「Go! Fight! Never give up!」
			DATAFORM 「Do your best until the very end!」
			DATAFORM 「You can do it! You can do it―!」
			DATAFORM 「We're all on your side―!」
			DATAFORM 「You're not alone! I'm with you all the way―!」
			DATAFORM 「Go! Go! Go! Go!」
			DATAFORM 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, the strongest warrior―! Make it happen―!」
		ENDDATA
		PRINTFORMDL Instead of training with you, Tewi watches from one side and cheers you on.
ENDSELECT
LOCAL = FIND_CHILD("53","Learning manners-Independent","Martial Arts",,"Here")
IF LOCAL
	PRINTFORMDL %CHILDNAME:53:LOCAL% joins your training, giving it %HIS_HER_CHILD(53,,LOCAL)% all.
ELSE
	LOCAL = FIND_CHILD("53","Learning manners-Independent",,,"Here")
	SIF LOCAL
		PRINTFORMDL %CHILDNAME:53:LOCAL% watches your training.
ENDIF
WAIT
RETURN 1

