		PRINTFORMDL Tewi refuses your offer.
	CASE 0,1
		SELECTCASE CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置/100
			CASE 2 ;Human Village. (Restaurant)
				SELECTCASE RAND:2
					CASE 0
						PRINTFORML 「They sure have a lot of different kinds of food here.」
						PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G("I guess I'll try something new this time.:Well, I'm still gonna order a carrot dish.")%」
					CASE 1
						PRINTFORML 「That looks good, but it's so fatty... I'll order something a little healthier.」
						PRINTFORMDL Tewi shows some restraint in the restaurant.
				ENDSELECT
			CASE 4 ;Bamboo Forest of the Lost. (Mystia's stall)
				PRINTFORML 「The greens here are so good, all the rabbits love coming here.」
				PRINTFORMDL Although she says so, Tewi is surrounded by rabbits hungrily devouring grilled meat.
			CASE 6 ;Sanzu River～Netherworld. (Road of Liminality stall)
				PRINTFORML 「Oh, let's eat here.」
				PRINTFORMDL When Tewi goes up to a food stall, the manager bows obsequiously and rushes to serve her.
				PRINTFORML 「You want anything? It's my treat this time～」
