		IF TALENT:53:恋人 && !RAND:2
			PRINTFORML 「Oh, let me have some of that.」
			PRINTFORMDL After ordering different dishes, Tewi keeps filching from your plate.
			PRINTFORML 「And a bite of this, oh, and can I have this, too?」
			PRINTFORML 「Thaaank you%UNICODE(0x2764)%」
			PRINTFORMDL In payment, she kisses you on the cheek and grins at you.
		ELSEIF IS_FALLEN(53)
			PRINTFORML 「Can I have that? I'll trade you one of mine.」
			PRINTFORMDL Tewi starts nitpicking your plates until you've exchanged a number of side dishes.
			PRINTFORML 「Since we're here, we've got to try as much as we can!」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Mmm, this stuff's pretty good.」
			PRINTFORML 「This, too. Maybe I'll have more of this...」
			PRINTFORMDL For such a little rabbit, Tewi sure can put it away.
			PRINTFORML 「You've gotta eat well to have enough energy, you know?」
		ENDIF
		IF TFLAG:193
			PRINTFORML 「Hehe, I might end up having too much...」
			PRINTFORMDL Tewi looks very pleased while eating the meal.
		ENDIF
ENDSELECT
WAIT
RETURN 1

