@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_CUSTOM_COM_K53_1(JoinIn)
	;Go Swimming.
#DIM DYNAMIC JoinIn
CALL D_LINE
IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置/100 != 10 && FIRSTTIME("GoSwimming",0,53) ;No fish in the Lunar Capital.
	PRINTFORMW 「I don't need to get wet. Watch me!」
	PRINTFORMDW Tewi jumps towards the water's surface. Just before she reaches it, a huge fish jumps out and she bounces off of it.
	PRINTFORMDW When she comes back down, another one pops up, and then another... Tewi runs circles around you by stepping on fish.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDW ...If she's going to do that, what's the point of the swimsuit?
	PRINTFORMW 「I'll go in the water when I feel like it, okay?」
	RETURN 1
ENDIF
IF TEQUIP:MASTER:900
	PRINTFORMDL You swim in the water with Tewi...
	PRINTW
	SELECTCASE RAND:4
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「Watch the rare and amazing water rabbit's feats of aquatic prowess!」
			PRINTFORMDL Tewi slowly swims across the surface using the breaststroke.
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORMDL Tewi paddles over and holds on to you.
			PRINTFORML 「Swim fast! Let's go together!」
			PRINTFORMDL You tow her around so she doesn't have to swim herself.
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORMDW You invite Tewi to dive under the surface with you, but she shakes her head.
			PRINTFORML 「It'll mess up my ears and my hair...」
			PRINTFORML 「I don't wanna be a wet rabbit!」
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORML 「I'll do it this way!」
			PRINTFORMDL Tewi uses a rabbit as a flutterboard and swims by kicking her legs.
			PRINTFORMDL The rabbit has to kick and splash around just to stay afloat...
	ENDSELECT
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDL You and Tewi get out of the water...
	PRINTW
	SELECTCASE RAND:2
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「Sweet land, I missed you...」
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「Well, that was fun I guess.」
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
WAIT
RETURN 1

